[38;5;153m❯[39m [38;5;246m1.[39m [38;5;153mHard cut (Recommended)[39m
     [38;5;246mslice(0, maxLength - 3) + '...'. Predictable, always fills the budget, behaves the same for prose, IDs, URLs and [39m
     [38;5;246mpaths.[39m
